message: "If you use OTShield Bench, please cite the software release."
title: "OTShield Bench"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Jayachandra Reddy"
    family-names: "Palle"
version: "0.5.1-alpha"
date-released: 2026-09-20
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22863660"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ASHTHRA/otshield-bench"
url: "https://github.com/ASHTHRA/otshield-bench/releases/tag/v0.5.1-alpha"
abstract: >-
  OTShield Bench is a reproducible, vendor-neutral benchmark for operational
  technology cyber-detection effectiveness, deployment resource cost, and
  resilience under degraded connectivity. Version 0.5.1-alpha includes
  isolated OpenPLC laboratory evidence using bounded read-only Modbus/TCP
  Function Code 3 traffic and a five-trial repeatability study.
keywords:
  - operational technology
  - industrial control systems
  - cybersecurity
  - Modbus TCP
  - OpenPLC
  - detection benchmarking
  - resilience
  - reproducibility
